iness_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"25hhqe_CFWcyFOVQeW7Kfw","review_id":"khMxiM3KCpR80nbjxVRXVg","date":"2016-02-20T02:40:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9443139433860779,"text_excerpt":"One thing I really enjoy...and that's a Good Burger... Moo-Yah with a menu that even caters to gluten free (order the lettuce wrapped burger) gets my two thumbs up. You get a ton of options like grilled onions and sauteed mushrooms for FREE! Not to mention sauces they even have BBQ for all you yanks! Now about that burger it comes on a fresh bun that is as fluffy as the clouds in the sky. The patty itself is of decent proportion. The flavor is what does it for me...seasoned to perfection. No real need for a sauce! You have your plethora of add on like sweet potato fries or hand cut fresh with just enough salt. Want a shake try the oreo cookie shake \"warning its extra thick\" takes 20 min t..."},{"business_id":"25hhqe_CFWcyFOVQeW7Kfw","review_id":"ACwx6kacb9lPZknvrscakg","date":"2019-12-27T22:41:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9408800601959229,"text_excerpt":"Mooyah was so delicious! First time here so I went with a classic meal, Mooyah cheeseburger. These are great steak burgers! If you're looking for a good steak burger but still wanna do fast food, come to this place. They also have other locations throughout the city if you don't want to make a trip to the Riverwalk! Ps. Their potato fries are so crispy and made just right. They also have the option of sweet potato fries."},{"business_id":"25hhqe_CFWcyFOVQeW7Kfw","review_id":"_K2xn8-NNK9_0oYaRA0rIg","date":"2015-06-22T02:06:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9394015073776245,"text_excerpt":"Great burger! They make these things fresh and they are sooooooo juicy. The fries are hand cut and very fresh, they don't sit there and get all soggy. This is by far the best place to eat in the outlet mall, and you won't spend that much money on what you want either. The staff is pleasant and you get your food quick."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"25hhqe_CFWcyFOVQeW7Kfw","photo_id":"ai1aVmAqAy7mvK2sYRqwNw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ai1aVmAqAy7mvK2sYRqwNw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9687633514404297},{"business_id":"25hhqe_CFWcyFOVQeW7Kfw","photo_id":"tHUzC4DwaYqAZ6Cf0g6YfQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/tHUzC4DwaYqAZ6Cf0g6YfQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9664270877838135},{"business_id":"25hhqe_CFWcyFOVQeW7Kfw","photo_id":"MbRi3iQ7lg06TEyJrPkkbQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/MbRi3iQ7lg06TEyJrPkkbQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9629302024841309},{"business_id":"25hhqe_CFWcyFOVQeW7Kfw","photo_id":"iPsKIA0dWXlcSkw4fxf5jg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/iPsKIA0dWXlcSkw4fxf5jg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9416041374206543},{"business_id":"25hhqe_CFWcyFOVQeW7Kfw","photo_id":"q-_nE14C4lN0oCiAoXQyVQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/q-_nE14C4lN0oC